{"unit_id":"shittass__dsh-gui-browser#card-zh","repo":"shittass/dsh-gui-browser","commit":"4ba29860e5c303dd96845f17f64c322c8bec1ab5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gui-browser（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在右侧栏实时查看和操作当前会话内置 Chromium。Host 连接 Playwright 启动的浏览器并把页面画面通过 WebSocket 送到侧栏，侧栏的鼠标、键盘、输入法和剪贴板操作会传回同一页面。可切换页面、导航、滚动、输入文字并查看状态；用户操作摘要会在下一轮提供给模型。适合需要在图形界面检查并接管模型浏览器的场景。需要启用 browser-use 与 Playwright MCP provider。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:18-34","cordis.patch.yml:20-37","client.js:1074-1158","engine.js:1495-1503"]}
{"unit_id":"shittass__dsh-gui-browser#card-en","repo":"shittass/dsh-gui-browser","commit":"4ba29860e5c303dd96845f17f64c322c8bec1ab5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gui-browser (DSH Web plugin) mirrors the session's Chromium in the right sidebar. It streams page frames and forwards mouse, keyboard, and text input to the browser. Users can navigate and switch pages; action summaries reach the model on its next turn. Requires browser-use and Playwright MCP.","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:18-34","cordis.patch.yml:20-37","client.js:1074-1158","engine.js:1495-1503"]}
