{"unit_id":"shittass__dsh-gui-browser#feature-1","repo":"shittass/dsh-gui-browser","commit":"4ba29860e5c303dd96845f17f64c322c8bec1ab5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gui-browser 的功能「浏览器实时镜像」：在 Web GUI 右侧栏显示会话内置 Chromium 的当前画面。浏览器启动后自动打开侧栏页面，画面经 WebSocket 推送并在绘制后确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1074-1158","engine.js:1972-1980"]}
{"unit_id":"shittass__dsh-gui-browser#feature-2","repo":"shittass/dsh-gui-browser","commit":"4ba29860e5c303dd96845f17f64c322c8bec1ab5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gui-browser 的功能「交互与导航」：在侧栏对镜像页面点击、滚动、输入文字或使用地址栏导航，Host 将输入转成浏览器控制事件；支持页面切换和常用浏览器动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1-16","engine.js:1519-1537"]}
{"unit_id":"shittass__dsh-gui-browser#feature-3","repo":"shittass/dsh-gui-browser","commit":"4ba29860e5c303dd96845f17f64c322c8bec1ab5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gui-browser 的功能「同步手动操作」：侧栏操作会被压缩为会话级摘要，并作为运行时上下文提供给模型，使下一步模型请求获知用户对浏览器做过的操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine.js:1390-1400","engine.js:1495-1503"]}
